+### Performance Optimization
+
+`build_trt_pipeline.py` supports quantization plus additional execution optimizations
+via `--execution-profile optimized --quantization <policy>`. Two quantization policies
+are available: `mixed_nvfp4` (fastest — used in the steps below) and `fp8`; see
+[Optimized TensorRT Result](#optimized-tensorrt-result) for measured numbers. These
+optimizations were developed and validated on Jetson AGX Thor.
+
+The steps below use the Jetson AGX Thor Docker container as the example. Set up the
+environment following [Jetson Thor Setup](#jetson-thor-setup) first, then run the
+following inside the container:
+
+1. Install ModelOpt (required for mixed-precision quantization). `uv` is
+   preinstalled in the container and targets `/opt/gr00t-venv`; bare `pip` would
+   install into the system Python instead:
+
+   ```bash
+   uv pip install "nvidia-modelopt[onnx]==0.39.0"
+   ```
+
+2. Download and prepare the calibration dataset used by the quantized builds. The GR00T-specific `modality.json` must be copied into
+   the dataset's `meta/` directory, and normalization statistics generated once(`stats.py` writes `meta/stats.json` / `meta/relative_stats.json`, which the calibration data pipeline needs):
+
+   ```bash
+   hf download --repo-type dataset IPEC-COMMUNITY/libero_10_no_noops_1.0.0_lerobot \
+     --local-dir examples/LIBERO/libero_10_no_noops_1.0.0_lerobot/
+   cp examples/LIBERO/modality.json examples/LIBERO/libero_10_no_noops_1.0.0_lerobot/meta/
+
+   export PYTHONPATH=/workspace/repo
+   python gr00t/data/stats.py \
+     --dataset-path examples/LIBERO/libero_10_no_noops_1.0.0_lerobot \
+     --embodiment-tag LIBERO_PANDA
+   ```
+
+3. Build with the optimized profile (`PYTHONPATH` makes the mounted repo importable):
+
+   ```bash
+   python scripts/deployment/build_trt_pipeline.py \
+     --model-path checkpoints/GR00T-N1.7-LIBERO/libero_10 \
+     --dataset-path demo_data/libero_demo \
+     --embodiment-tag LIBERO_PANDA \
+     --output-dir ./gr00t_trt_optimized_mixed_nvfp4 \
+     --execution-profile optimized \
+     --quantization mixed_nvfp4 \
+     --calib-dataset-path examples/LIBERO/libero_10_no_noops_1.0.0_lerobot \
+     --calib-size 10
+   ```
+
+   Expected: the verify step reports cosine similarity in the 0.998–0.999+ range,
+   and the full pipeline takes ~6 minutes on Thor. For measured latency and accuracy,
+   see [Optimized TensorRT Result](#optimized-tensorrt-result).
+
+4. Run inference with the optimized engines by pointing the
+   [Standalone Inference with TRT](#standalone-inference-with-trt) command at the
+   new output directory: `--trt-engine-path ./gr00t_trt_optimized_mixed_nvfp4/engines`.
+
